  "prefLabel": "Liq 1102.01 Permits For Licensees In Their State Of Domicile",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 1102.01 Permits For Licensees In Their State Of Domicile. Persons currently licensed in their state of domicile as a wine manufacturer, beverage manufacturer, importer, wholesaler, or retailer, or equivalents thereof may apply for a direct shipper permit from the commission pursuant to these rules.\n\nSource. #12968, eff 1-3-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
